    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Hard</strong> is a minimalist puzzle game where every room is a mystery to solve. No tutorials, no hints \u2013 everything relies on your logic, observation skills, and ability to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept is simple but demanding: each level introduces new elements and mechanics, making the puzzles increasingly complex. Only the most perceptive minds will uncover the game's secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>No assistance</strong> \u2013 It's up to you to figure out the rules.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Progressive difficulty</strong> \u2013 Each room presents a unique challenge.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Experimentation-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 Observe, test, and deduce.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A minimalist and intriguing atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Let the mystery unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box Hard</strong> won\u2019t hold your hand. Here, only your intelligence will guide you forward. Are you ready for the challenge?</p>",
